      "side": 1,
      "message": "There have been a couple of threads on this and discussion about alternative with pros/cons (e.g. genrule). Given LLVM team request to avoid genrule, and that this is a build variant (which if accepted, we would remove the flag), in order to move forward, I feel strongly we do need this type of global change. It doesn\u0027t affect the normal builds and can be removed. Thank you.",
